  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Privatisation of state-owned banks in RS, BiH, phase III. The goal is to continue activities started in 1999 but delayed due to the war in Kosovo. Three long-term and a number of specialised short-term consultants are financed. The project is initiated and co-ordinated b the World Bank. The project-activities will last for c:a 23 months.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Privatisering av banker i RS, BiH, fas III. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att forts&#xe4;tta de privatiseringsprocess som p&#xe5;b&#xf6;rjats under 1999 men som blivit f&#xf6;rsena pga Kosovo-kriget. Tre l&#xe5;ngtidskonsulter och ett antal specialiserade korttidskonsulter finansieras. Projektet &#xe4;r initierat och samordnat a V&#xe4;rldsbanken. Aktiviteterna kommer att p&#xe5;g&#xe5; under c:a 23 m&#xe5;nader.</narrative>
  </description>
